tatami-convdb(8)

# NAME

tatami convdb - convert v2 installed database to v3 format

# SYNOPSIS

*tatami convdb*

# DESCRIPTION

*tatami convdb* converts to current installed database to v3 format and
outputs a corresponding *installed.adb* file.

# OPTIONS

*tatami convdb* does not support any specific options. See *tatami*(8) for global
options.
